{
  "chapterId": 86,
  "translation": {
    "source": "QuranEnc.com",
    "sourceUrl": "https://quranenc.com/en/home/api",
    "title": "English Translation - Noor International Center",
    "version": "1.1.2"
  },
  "verses": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "arabicText": " وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلطَّارِقِ",
      "englishText": "By the sky and the knocker",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "arabicText": "وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلطَّارِقُ",
      "englishText": "And what can make you know what is the knocker?",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "arabicText": "ٱلنَّجْمُ ٱلثَّاقِبُ",
      "englishText": "It is the piercing star[1901].",
      "footnotes": "[1901] Whose light pierces through the darkness.",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "arabicText": "إِن كُلُّ نَفْسٍ لَّمَّا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌ",
      "englishText": "There is no soul but that it has over it a protector.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "arabicText": "فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ",
      "englishText": "So let man observe from what he was created.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "arabicText": "خُلِقَ مِن مَّآءٍ دَافِقٍ",
      "englishText": "He was created from a fluid, ejected,",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "arabicText": "يَخْرُجُ مِنۢ بَيْنِ ٱلصُّلْبِ وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ",
      "englishText": "Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "arabicText": "إِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ رَجْعِهِۦ لَقَادِرٌ",
      "englishText": "Indeed, He [i.e., Allāh], to return him [to life], is Able.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "arabicText": "يَوْمَ تُبْلَى ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ",
      "englishText": "The Day when secrets will be put on trial,[1902]",
      "footnotes": "[1902] i.e., exposed, examined and judged.",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "arabicText": "فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن قُوَّةٍ وَلَا نَاصِرٍ",
      "englishText": "Then he [i.e., man] will have no power or any helper.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "arabicText": "وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلرَّجْعِ",
      "englishText": "By the sky which sends back[1903]",
      "footnotes": "[1903] Rain, heat, sound waves, etc.",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "arabicText": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ ذَاتِ ٱلصَّدْعِ",
      "englishText": "And [by] the earth which splits,[1904]",
      "footnotes": "[1904] With plant growth or from geological rifts.",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "arabicText": "إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلٌ فَصْلٌ",
      "englishText": "Indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a decisive statement,",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "arabicText": "وَمَا هُوَ بِٱلْهَزْلِ",
      "englishText": "And it is not amusement.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "arabicText": "إِنَّهُمْ يَكِيدُونَ كَيْدًا",
      "englishText": "Indeed, they are planning a plan,",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "arabicText": "وَأَكِيدُ كَيْدًا",
      "englishText": "But I am planning a plan.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "arabicText": "فَمَهِّلِ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ أَمْهِلْهُمْ رُوَيْدًۢا",
      "englishText": "So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile.[1905]",
      "footnotes": "[1905] i.e., Do not be in haste for revenge, for you will see what will become of them.",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/086017.mp3"
    }
  ]
}
